{
  "slug": "sfagent-tools",
  "name": "Sfagent Tools",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered testing for Salesforce Agentforce agents. Claude reads your agent's topics, actions, and configuration, then autonomously generates and runs test conversations — probing edge cases, validating guardrails, checking topic routing — and produces a scored report with recommendations. Zero setup: uses your existing Salesforce CLI authentication. Define business rules in sfagent-config.yaml and get rule-by-rule pass/fail results. Watch every conversation in real-time via a live transcript. Works with all agent types including Service Agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **4 commands**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `sfagent-tools` (Use when testing or evaluating Salesforce Agentforce agents via headless conversations)\n- **Commands** (4): `explore` (Exploratory testing — Claude probes edge cases, guardrails, and multi-turn scenarios), `generate` (Autonomously generate and run a comprehensive test suite for an Agentforce agent (flagship feature)), `report` (Generate or regenerate a test report from the most recent test session), `test` (Run a test plan (YAML spec or natural language) against an Agentforce agent)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `sfagent-tools`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sfagent-tools@claude-community` from `lucianostraga/sfagent-tools`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
